                        "glosses": [
                            "Of or pertaining to ferns."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "444ac616-fe4e-316f-99c4-284b191ff6ec",
                        "entry_id": "e4fd731b-4921-3fbf-83e7-0d0bca9188db",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Resembling or characteristic of a fern, in appearance, smell, etc."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "06f0bec7-24d3-4ca5-bccb-a021ca117e9e",
                                "sense_id": "444ac616-fe4e-316f-99c4-284b191ff6ec",
                                "text": "All kinds of mosses grew by the stream—tufty, flat, ferny, and curly, green, yellow and a whitish kind that was tipped with scarlet sealing wax."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "420c9776-ad76-4c05-8c47-b370408d9fb7",
                                "sense_id": "444ac616-fe4e-316f-99c4-284b191ff6ec",
                                "text": "Ralph had stopped smiling and was pointing into the lagoon. Something creamy lay among the ferny weeds."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "22e4caf4-70b5-3460-8af3-7dd5712ceac1",
                        "entry_id": "e4fd731b-4921-3fbf-83e7-0d0bca9188db",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Covered in or filled with ferns; flanked or surrounded by ferns."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c258ab51-7474-40db-b2e6-81a8ec9d1924",
                                "sense_id": "22e4caf4-70b5-3460-8af3-7dd5712ceac1",
                                "text": "And from the bush there came the sound of little streams flowing, quickly, lightly, slipping between the smooth stones, gushing into ferny basins and out again; and there was the splashing of big drops on large leaves […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5a0a65b0-bbda-4460-9928-0cf5ef3dc560",
                                "sense_id": "22e4caf4-70b5-3460-8af3-7dd5712ceac1",
                                "text": "He skirted all stables, kennels, breweries, carpenters' shops, washhouses, places where they make tallow candles, kill oxen, forge horse-shoes, stitch jerkins—for the house was a town ringing with men at work at their various crafts—and gained the ferny path leading uphill through the park unseen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4f9e6632-073e-4b95-a04c-c5cad26770d7",
                                "sense_id": "22e4caf4-70b5-3460-8af3-7dd5712ceac1",
                                "text": "We'll walk over the spring fields and through those ferny old woods."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
